<title>POLAND: Poland's BRE to lead Krakchemia CP issue.</title>
<headline>Poland's BRE to lead Krakchemia CP issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Bank Rozwoju Exportu SA (BRE) will lead a 24-month commercial paper issue of the Krakchemia SA retailer with debt outstanding of 15 million zlotys, Krakchemia said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
